KYRiE
=====

This tree is a private development snapshot for packet observation and
Auriga-oriented reconstruction tooling.

- Source ZIP artifacts produced by tools.build_snapshot are not a public
  release and must not be treated as redistributable game data.
- Capture logs, packet databases, client executables, and .reference
  materials are excluded from Git and from source snapshots.
- Third-party Python dependencies retain their own licenses
  (see requirements.txt / requirements-lock.txt).
- A public distribution license for KYRiE itself is not fixed yet.
  Do not assume an open-source license from the presence of this NOTICE.
